{"content":[{"c":["ADDI"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. One whose descendants obeyed Ezra’s exhortation to divorce their pagan wives after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=1Esd.9.31","r":"1Esd.9.31","rawR":"1Esd.9.31","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Esd.9.31","value":"1Esd.9.31"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Esd 9:31"},"). The parallel list of Ezra has Pahath-moab in place of Addi (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.30","r":"Ezra.10.30","rawR":"Ezra.10.30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.30","value":"Ezra.10.30"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:30"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Ancestor of Jesus, mentioned in Luke’s genealogy (",{"href":"?bref=Luke.3.28","r":"Luke.3.28","rawR":"Luke.3.28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.3.28","value":"Luke.3.28"}],"t":"ref","v":"3:28"},"). ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=GenealogyofJesusChrist_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"GenealogyofJesusChrist_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"GenealogyofJesusChrist_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Genealogy of Jesus Christ"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Addi","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Esd 9:31","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Esd.9.31","rawQueryValue":"1Esd.9.31","sourceRefExact":"1Esd.9.31"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.30","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.30","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.30"},{"anchorText":"3:28","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Luke.3.28","rawQueryValue":"Luke.3.28","sourceRefExact":"Luke.3.28"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"fa9133bc62f6b389a9fa76b237d4e4a0104dd181a62a6e422466953ad5fe574b","sourceItemName":"Addi","sourceItemOrder":113,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementP